      "extract": "The Polyanalytic Ginibre Ensembles Antti Haimi and Håkan Hedenmalm Abstract. For integers n, q = 1, 2, 3, . . ., let Poln,q denote the C-linear space of polynomials in z and ¯z, of degree ≤n −1 in z and of degree ≤q −1 in ¯z. We supply Poln,q with the inner product structure of L2 \u0010 C, e−m|z|2dA \u0011 , where dA(z) = dxdy π , z = x + iy; the resulting Hilbert space is denoted by Polm,n,q. Here, it is assumed that m is a",
