      "extract": "We show that the Berezin measures have the convergence ${\\mathrm d}B^{\\langle z\\rangle}_{m,n,q}\\to{\\mathrm d}\\omega_z$ for $z\\in{\\mathbb D}^e$ as $m,n\\to+\\infty$ while $n=m+\\mathrm{O}(1)$. Here, $\\omega_z$ is harmonic measure with respect to the point $z$ and the exterior disk $\\mathbb{D}^e$. We first study the concentration of the Berezin measure to neighborhoods of the closed unit disk $\\bar{\\mathbb D}$. We recall",
