      "extract": "In this section, we will calculate the limit of the blow-up berezin transform $\\hat{\\berd}^{\\langle z\\rangle}_{m,n,q}$ at a boundary point $z$, that is, $|z|=1$. There is no loss of generality to take $z=1$. Our strategy is to investigate the blow-up of the reproducing kernel of the space of analytic polynomials $\\mathrm{Pol}_{m,n,1}$ (with $q=1$) first, and then use this information together with poly-Bargmann",
